From 38c056a1baab25ba708d503a297c0aef82a321f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cettapack <cettapack@localhost>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:28:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] evprof: opt-in evaluator phase timers (CETTA_EVPROF=1), off
 by default

Exclusive per-function timers (rdtsc, cleanup-attribute scopes) on the
functions listed in src/cetta_evprof_sites.def, each tagged with an
evaluator phase; malloc/calloc/realloc/free wrapped at link
(-Wl,--wrap) as frames of their own; in-process overhead calibration;
JSON report at exit to $CETTA_EVPROF_OUT. With CETTA_EVPROF=0 (the
default) CETTA_EVPROF_SCOPE expands to nothing and cetta_evprof.c is
not built.
---
